Clock-domain interpretation:
  SIMDn names an ATT SIMD-select capture, not an independent hardware clock domain.
  SIMD-select captures are independent; maxima below are observations across captures, not simultaneous GPU state.
  A WGP contains four SIMD32s. Shader-cycle counters are not synchronized across SIMDs.
  Every raw shader span below is a delta within its own capture x SE series.
  Cross-SE maxima compare numeric span only; occupancy spans are not wall durations.
